#: client/components/NetworkLobby.vue
msgctxt "presence.globalAway"
msgid "{mode} · global · away"
msgstr "{mode} · globale · assente"

#. Tooltip and screen-reader text of the presence dot by a network's name in the sidebar. {mode} is a presence mode name (Online, Auto, Away). The ' · ' separator joins short qualifiers; keep it. The network follows the global mode and is not connected.
