#: client/js/helpers/dnd.ts
msgctxt "presence.mode.auto"
msgid "Auto"
msgstr ""

#. Presence mode name, a word or two (menu item, select option and status text). Presence modes: Online (never away), Auto (away when the user is not looking at the app), Away (always away), Do not disturb (away and silenced), Same as global (a network follows the global mode set from the pill under the logo). This one: always shown as away.
#: client/js/helpers/dnd.ts
msgctxt "presence.mode.away"
msgid "Away"
msgstr "Assente"

#. Presence mode name, a word or two (menu item, select option and status text). Presence modes: Online (never away), Auto (away when the user is not looking at the app), Away (always away), Do not disturb (away and silenced), Same as global (a network follows the global mode set from the pill under the logo). This one: away, and no notifications or sounds.
#: client/js/helpers/dnd.ts
msgctxt "presence.mode.dnd"
msgid "Do not disturb"
